## Testing & Quality Discipline

### 1. Schema & Property Testing
Use Hypothesis to test data contracts and edge cases (NaNs, empty strings, boundary numbers):

```python
def test_silver_deduplication() -> None:
    """Verify silver layer correctly deduplicates records by primary key."""
    # Given: records with duplicate IDs
    # When: running silver transformation
    # Then: output dataframe has distinct records with latest timestamp preserved
```

### 2. Verification Commands
Always verify changes locally using `just`:
```bash
# Install agent skills
just setup-skills

# Run pipeline test suite
just test

# Check formatting and linting
just lint

# Format code automatically
just format

# Full validation (lint + test)
just check

# Run the pipeline
just run
```
